{
  "info": {
    "name": "RoomBook API",
    "description": "The RoomBook brownfield lab (Express + TypeScript + in-memory SQLite).\n\n1. `npm install`, then `npm run dev` (API on http://localhost:3001).\n2. The collection pre-request script sets `today` and `tomorrow`, so the seeded bookings are always found.\n3. **Create a booking** saves `bookingId`, so **Cancel** acts on it. `userId` is who is acting (1 = Ana, 2 = Ben, ...).\n\nSeed (today): Aspen 09:00-10:00 and 10:00-11:00, Birch 13:00-14:30, Cedar 09:30-11:00, Dogwood 15:00-16:00. Rooms: 1 Aspen (4), 2 Birch (6), 3 Cedar (8), 4 Dogwood (12), 5 Elm (2), 6 Fir (20). Times are office-local text like 2030-01-07T09:30.\n\nThe last two folders are the tickets: they fail until the work is done.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const pad = n => String(n).padStart(2, '0');",
          "const fmt = d => d.getFullYear() + '-' + pad(d.getMonth() + 1) + '-' + pad(d.getDate());",
          "const now = new Date();",
          "const next = new Date(now.getTime() + 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('today', fmt(now));",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('tomorrow', fmt(next));"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "today",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tomorrow",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "bookingId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Rooms, users and the day view",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List rooms",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rooms",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["rooms"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status is 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"6 rooms\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.length(6));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "List users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test(\"Status is 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Bookings for today",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/bookings?date={{today}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["bookings"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "date",
                  "value": "{{today}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status is 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"5 seeded bookings\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.length(5));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Bookings for tomorrow",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/bookings?date={{tomorrow}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["bookings"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "date",
                  "value": "{{tomorrow}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test(\"Status is 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Missing date (400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/bookings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["bookings"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test(\"Status is 400\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Create and cancel bookings",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create a booking (Elm, 09:00-10:00)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/bookings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["bookings"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"roomId\": 5,\n  \"userId\": {{userId}},\n  \"title\": \"Interview\",\n  \"start\": \"{{today}}T09:00\",\n  \"end\": \"{{today}}T10:00\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status is 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"bookingId\", pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Overlapping booking (409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/bookings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["bookings"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"roomId\": 1,\n  \"userId\": {{userId}},\n  \"title\": \"Clash\",\n  \"start\": \"{{today}}T10:30\",\n  \"end\": \"{{today}}T11:30\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test(\"Status is 409\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "End before start (400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/bookings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["bookings"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"roomId\": 5,\n  \"userId\": {{userId}},\n  \"title\": \"Backwards\",\n  \"start\": \"{{today}}T10:00\",\n  \"end\": \"{{today}}T09:00\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test(\"Status is 400\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Unknown room (404)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/bookings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["bookings"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"roomId\": 99,\n  \"userId\": {{userId}},\n  \"title\": \"Nowhere\",\n  \"start\": \"{{today}}T09:00\",\n  \"end\": \"{{today}}T10:00\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test(\"Status is 404\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel as someone else (403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}?userId=2",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["bookings", "{{bookingId}}"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "userId",
                  "value": "2"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test(\"Status is 403\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel the booking as its owner",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}?userId={{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["bookings", "{{bookingId}}"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "userId",
                  "value": "{{userId}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test(\"Status is 204\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
